WEBVTT

00:11:59.076 --> 00:12:00.516
en we deden het.

00:12:00.556 --> 00:12:01.956
Want dat is de kracht

00:12:01.956 --> 00:12:05.156
van diversiteit en integratie 
in de wetenschap.

00:12:05.156 --> 00:12:06.316
Dank je.

00:12:06.316 --> 00:12:09.476
(Applaus)

00:12:09.516 --> 00:12:13.596
(Gejuich)